[by: LRCLIB contributors (timing) and Lyrical Nonsense contributors (lyrics)]
[00:06.32] Futo shita shunkan ni kimi wa inai
[00:14.12] Kodoku ga mune no oku hidoku tataku
[00:19.94] Tameiki no yoru wa hoshitachi miage
[00:27.09] Kuchibiru wo kande inoru
[00:32.84] Yoake ga kuru tabi kimi e to hashitteku
[00:39.38] Kizudarake no kimi wa egao de gomakasu kedo
[00:46.54] Kizuiteru watashi kodomo janai yo
[00:53.04] Sekaijuu teki ni mawashitemo kimi wo mamoru yo
